    "displayName": "Orison Relief: Large Supply Haul",
    "titleSource": "localized_clean",
    "titleConfidence": "high",
    "briefing": "Hey, it’s El.\n\nOff the bat – this particular job’s a big deal, so if you’re looking to take this one on for us, make sure you’re confident in your ability to do a job well. \n\nWe’ve been contracted by Crusader to deliver medical supplies to [Destination]. Pick up’s at [Location]. Bear in mind, this is gonna be a big one, so make sure bring a handheld tractor beam and a ship that can hold [MissionMaxSCUSize] cargo containers otherwise it might be a little rough.\n\nI can’t stress the importance of this contract enough – lots of good people got hurt in those attacks, and it’s our responsibility to do what we can to help them in the aftermath. We owe the victims that much, at the very least.\n\nLet’s do right by them,\n\nElla Tieno \nJr. Logistics Coordinator \nCovalex Shipping   \n'Anything you need, anywhere you need it.'",
